WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.494
Video 20. TDS: source par kaapvaano tax.

00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:11.051
F11 dabaavo, TDS chaalu karo, ane company no
TAN lakho.

00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:14.837
Duties & Taxes hethal TDS ledger banaavo.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:21.132
Party ne teno PAN, deductee type ane nature of
payment aapo, jem ke bhaadu.

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:30.554
TDS on Rent ledger Duties & Taxes hethal chhe. Teni
duty type TDS chhe, ane nature bhaadu chhe.

00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:37.978
Makaan maalik, Desai Properties, paase PAN,
deductee type ane nature bhaadu chhe.

00:00:39.854 --> 00:00:51.653
V, pachhi payment maate F5 dabaavo. HDFC Bank, pachhi Desai
Properties pasand karo: ₹60,000 bhaadu, advance ma.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:01:01.210
Hisaab TDS on Rent line jaate umere chhe:
-6,000. Bank ₹54,000 chukve chhe.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:07.323
Narration lakho, ane Ctrl+A dabaavo. Payment
save thaay chhe.

00:01:08.474 --> 00:01:11.040
Bhaadu ₹60,000 chhe.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:14.709
TDS 10% chhe: ₹6,000.

00:01:14.639 --> 00:01:21.656
Makaan maalik ne ₹54,000 male chhe. TDS tame
sarkaar ne bharo chho.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:34.572
Alt+G, 26Q. Form 26Q, have Form 140, quarter no TDS bhego
kare chhe: ₹60,000 chukvya, ₹6,000 kaapya.

00:01:34.602 --> 00:01:42.119
Alt+X thi e-return bane chhe. Upload pehla
file sarkaar na FVU thi chakaaso.

00:01:42.599 --> 00:01:44.867
Aagalno video: Payroll.

